---
description: Enterprise Spring Boot AI configuration — entry point and rule files
alwaysApply: true
---
All rules live under `ai/`. Read and follow, in order:
@AGENTS.md
@ai/AI_BEHAVIOR.md
@ai/CAPACITY.md
@ai/ARCHITECTURE.md
@ai/BACKEND_RULES.md
@ai/TESTING.md
@ai/REVIEW.md
@ai/PROJECT_MEMORY.md

Task recipes are in `ai/skills/<name>/SKILL.md` — before a common task (endpoint, entity,
consumer, cache, deployment), read the matching skill. End every non-trivial task with
`ai/skills/sync-docs/SKILL.md`.
Every task ends with the AI Run Report from `ai/CAPACITY.md`; `FAILED` with a reason beats a false `OK`.
